# Prettier's markdown formatter treats `{/* comment */}` (the only JSX comment
# MDX accepts) as emphasis and mangles it into `{/_ comment _/}` — silently
# breaking the file for both Storybook's MDX indexer and docs.search.mjs
# (unterminated-regex parse error). Confirmed on storybook/docs/Overview.mdx.
*.mdx

# Prettier's SCSS printer can silently change Sass semantics, not just
# whitespace: wrapping a parenthesized space-separated list onto multiple
# lines added a trailing comma, turning `(a b c)` (one space-list) into
# `(a b c,)` (a comma-list containing that space-list) — confirmed on
# src/styles/src/vendors/_gridaflex-settings.scss ($breakpoint-classes),
# which broke gridaflex's arithmetic at Storybook build time with no lint
# error beforehand. Combined with the `///` doc-comment fragility (see
# docs.config.mjs's joinWrappedVarCalls), the risk of a silent, undetected
# corruption outweighs consistent indentation here.
*.scss
